# Augmentation Evoker — SimC Lab's own reference profile.
#
# SimulationCraft has no profile for this specialization in the current season, so this one stands in for it.
# It is dropped the moment SimulationCraft publishes its own: nothing here overrides the engine.
#
# Gear and talents: Icy Veins, patch 12.1, read 2026-09-25.
#   https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/augmentation-evoker-pve-dps-gear-best-in-slot
#   Talent build supplied by the SimC Lab maintainer on 2026-09-25 (Icy Veins' talent page was not used)
# Overall best in slot for Midnight Season 2, with gems, enchants and consumables from https://www.icy-veins.com/wow/augmentation-evoker-pve-dps-gems-enchants-consumables. Mastery is the stat the guide stacks, so the ring enchant, flask and potion are the mastery ones.
# Item levels, enchant ranks and the crafting cap come from the pinned game data, not from the guide.
# Written by scripts/build-profiles.mjs from profiles/evoker-augmentation.json — edit that, not this file.

